    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to him but he's super busy and i can't get an appointment for like two weeks. i really need my adderall to get work done though. do you think it's actually dangerous or just like a little bit of extra anxiety? like could i just maybe take a half dose for a bit to see if it's okay?",
