    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just really worried about my job if i can't focus. i mean, i feel fine overall, it's just the jitters. if i take it with something to calm me down, like a beta blocker or even just some extra magnesium, would that make it safe enough to keep my normal dose? i just need to know if there's a way to make it work so i don't fall behind at work.",
